 Okay, let's see. Tiffanu needs to make a total of 17 brownies for her party, but she has already baked 8. So first, I should figure out how many more brownies she needs to make. That would be 17 minus 8, right? Let me check that. Yeah, 17 total needed, subtract the 8 she already made, so 17 - 8 = 9. So she needs to make 9 more brownies.

